@startuml
title Smart Apartment System - Amenities Module (1/3: AMENITY MANAGEMENT)

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam dpi 75

actor Admin as A
actor Resident as R
participant "Client App" as App
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Amenities API" as API
database "Database" as DB

note over A, Gateway: Admin requests include: Authorization: Bearer {admin_token}
note over R, Gateway: Resident requests include: Authorization: Bearer {resident_token}

== ADMIN: CREATE AMENITY ==

A -> App: Create new amenity
App -> Gateway: POST /amenities\n{name, slotTypeId, statusId, location, rules, imageUrl}
Gateway -> API: Forward with validation
API -> DB: Insert new amenity (check duplicate name)
DB --> API: amenity_id
API --> Gateway: 201 Created {id, message}
Gateway --> App: Success
App --> A: "Swimming Pool created"

== ADMIN: UPDATE AMENITY ==

A -> App: Update amenity details
App -> Gateway: PUT /amenities/{amenityId}\n{name, location, rules, isActive}
Gateway -> API: Forward update
API -> DB: Update amenity record
DB --> API: Updated
API --> Gateway: 200 OK {message}
Gateway --> App: Success
App --> A: "Amenity updated successfully"

== ADMIN: VIEW ALL AMENITIES ==

A -> App: View all amenities
App -> Gateway: GET /amenities?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&searchName=pool
Gateway -> API: Forward request
API -> DB: Fetch amenities filtered by name with pagination
DB --> API: Amenities list with pagination info
API --> Gateway: 200 OK {data, pagination}
Gateway --> App: Display amenities
App --> A: "Showing 10 amenities"

== ADMIN: DELETE AMENITY ==

A -> App: Delete amenity
App -> Gateway: DELETE /amenities/{amenityId}
Gateway -> API: Forward request
API -> DB: Check if any slots exist for this amenity
DB --> API: slot_count

alt slot_count == 0
    API -> DB: Delete amenity record
    DB --> API: Deleted
    API --> Gateway: 200 OK {message}
    Gateway --> App: Success
    App --> A: "Amenity deleted successfully"
else slot_count > 0
    API --> Gateway: 400 Bad Request\n"Cannot delete amenity with existing slots"
    Gateway --> App: Error
    App --> A: "Cannot delete: Delete slots first"
end

== RESIDENT: VIEW AVAILABLE AMENITIES ==

R -> App: Browse amenities
App -> Gateway: GET /amenities?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Gateway -> API: Forward with role check
API -> DB: Fetch all active amenities with pagination
DB --> API: Active amenities list
API --> Gateway: 200 OK {data, pagination}
Gateway --> App: Display amenities
App --> R: "Showing: Swimming Pool, Gym, Badminton Court..."

@enduml
